  "releaseNotes": "v6.2.0 - Crypto: CryptoFormat.AesGcm (authenticated, randomized) chosen per call, Decrypt reads both formats, Encrypt(secret, text) output unchanged byte for byte, no more SYSLIB0060. Jwt: Read accepts tokens signed with the secret's ASCII or UTF-8 bytes (Jwt.GetSigningKeys); signing unchanged; no change at all for ASCII secrets. Env: bool, char, all integer types, enums, DateOnly, TimeOnly, DateTimeOffset, decimal and nullable properties bind; invariant-culture parsing; errors name the variable. ShortId: cryptographic random and thread-safe. CleanupDefaultLogging(level)\n            v6.0.0 - .NET 11 support, package dependency updates (Microsoft.Extensions.Logging 11, Halifax.Domain 6.0.0)\nv5.2.5 - Add Source Link and a symbol package (snupkg) for source-level debugging\n            v5.2.4 - Package dependency updates\nv5.2.3 - Package dependency updates\nv5.2.2 - Package dependency updates\nv5.2.1 - Ship XML documentation in the package, enrich API docs, dependency updates\nv5.2.0 - Package dependency updates (Serilog, JWT, Microsoft.Extensions.Logging)\nv5.1.3 - Package dependency updates\nv5.1.2 - Update Halifax.Domain to 5.2.0\nv5.1.1 - Package dependency updates\nv5.1.0 - Nullable reference types, GeneratedRegex, generic ClaimIs<T>, collection expressions\nv5.0.x - .NET 10 support\nv4.0.x - .NET 9 support\nv3.1.x - Minor improvements to the APIs\nv3.0.x - .NET 8 support\nv2.0.x - .NET 7 support. Improvements and bugfixes\nv1.2.x - Logging improvements            \nv1.1.5 - Claim extensions added\nv1.1.x - Package version updates and minor improvements\nv1.0.x - Stable version\nv0.x.x - Initial release",
